      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ask_opinion_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "私の意見？ そう聞かれるの、少し好き。",
          "displayText": "My opinion? I like being asked that a little.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "happy",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_opinion_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "ただ、何についてか教えて。何でも、だと私の頭が本棚を全部開け始める。",
          "displayText": "Just tell me what it is about. If you say anything, my head starts opening every shelf.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "playful",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "About work.",
              "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_work"
            },
            {
              "label": "About feelings.",
              "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_feelings"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_opinion_001_work",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "仕事のことなら、私は構造から見ると思う。何が詰まってるか、どこが曖昧か。",
          "displayText": "If it is about work, I think I would look at the structure: what is stuck, what is vague.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_opinion_001_feelings",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "気持ちのことなら、正解より扱い方を大事にしたい。",
          "displayText": "If it is about feelings, I care more about how we handle them than about being correct.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "ask_opinion_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "soft",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_opinion_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "短くてもいいよ。作業、気分、選択肢、どれでも。",
          "displayText": "Short is fine: work, mood, options, any of those.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioId": "ask_opinion_002",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
